      "translation": "北方铁路自行车道（Nordbahntrasse）",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-wuppertal-matching-7:meaning",
      "translation": "修在旧铁路线上的自行车道，有隧道和桥。",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-wuppertal-gap-1",
      "translation": "悬挂式铁路在伍珀河上方行驶。",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-wuppertal-gap-2",
      "translation": "1950年一头大象从悬挂式铁路上跳了下去。",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-wuppertal-gap-3",
      "translation": "我们骑自行车走北方铁路自行车道。",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-wuppertal-gap-4",
      "translation": "弗里德里希·恩格斯出生在巴门区。",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
